{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600030","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1260003001:0":{"text":"익숙한 초록색 괴물의 곁에 나타난 여성은 전에 땅거미 숲에서 보았던 그 모습이었다...!","source_cn":"那熟悉的绿色怪物身边出现的女性，正是曾在薄暮丛林见到过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2616A78BB52F4C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1260003002:0":{"text":"...너희들... 또 만났군.","source_cn":"……你们。又见面了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x272A34DB18C9E455","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1260003003:0":{"text":"...세, <style=\"highlight\">세시아</style>?!","source_cn":"——瑟、<style=highlight>瑟西娅</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C18C0872C7B9B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1260003004:0":{"text":"당신이 어떻게 러스트 항에?!","source_cn":"你怎么会到锈锚港来？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE22D035F788C40E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1260003005:1":{"text":"저 그레이브본을 아십니까?","source_cn":"你们认识这个亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E34BE9EAD24996C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1260003006:1":{"text":"...죽음의 함대의 부하인가?","source_cn":"……你是死潮舰队的部下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67D2809D84A910F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1260003007:1":{"text":"죽음의 함대? 무례하군. 그 비린내 나는 야만인과 날 비교하지 마. 내 하수인들조차 같은 취급하는 걸 기분 나빠할 정도니까.","source_cn":"死潮舰队？真冒犯。别把那群一身海腥味的粗人和我相提并论...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1164D5333AFA77A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1260003008:1":{"text":"저 초록색 넝쿨 괴물을 하수인이라고 부르다니.","source_cn":"竟然把那个绿色的藤蔓怪物称为仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39042E9BD2CE2705","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1260003009:1":{"text":"정말이지, 여긴 어떻게 상식이 없는 녀석들뿐이람.","source_cn":"真是的，这里怎么到处都是些没有见识的家伙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EA6CAF929D985DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1260003010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 나 조금 후회돼. 너의 선택엔 적어도 가치가 있잖아.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2070D50F3A80AEF1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 나 조금 후회돼. 너의 선택엔 적어도 가치가 있잖아.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 나 조금 후회돼. 너의 선택엔 적어도 가치가 있잖아.","variant_male_